3:T758,<h1>Terms and Conditions</h1><p><strong>Last Updated: January 16, 2026</strong></p><p>Welcome to OfficialUM1 ('we', 'us', or 'our'). By accessing our website (https://officialum1.com) and purchasing our digital products (accounts, services, boosts), you agree to be bound by the following Terms and Conditions.</p><h2>1. Digital Products & Delivery</h2><ul><li><strong>Instant Delivery:</strong> Most account details (e.g., Reddit, Instagram) are delivered instantly via email and dashboard upon payment confirmation.</li><li><strong>Warranty Period:</strong> We provide a <strong>24-hour warranty</strong> on all accounts. You must verify access within this window.</li><li><strong>Replacements:</strong> If an account is invalid upon first login, we will replace it free of charge. We do not replace accounts banned due to user activity after the initial login.</li></ul><h2>2. No Refunds Policy</h2><p>Due to the nature of digital goods (which cannot be returned), <strong>all sales are final</strong>. We do not offer refunds once the account credentials have been revealed or sent to you, unless the product is proven defective and no replacement is available.</p><h2>3. User Responsibilities</h2><ul><li>You are responsible for securing the accounts immediately after purchase (changing passwords, 2FA).</li><li>You agree not to use our products for illegal activities. We are not liable for how you use the purchased assets.</li></ul><h2>4. Payments</h2><p>We accept payments via Stripe (Credit Card), Cryptomus (Cryptocurrency), and Binance Pay. All transactions are encrypted and secure.</p><h2>5. Service Adjustments</h2><p>Address: Sahiwal, Punjab, PK. We reserve the right to modify prices and inventory at any time without prior notice.</p><h2>6. Contact</h2><p>For support, please email <strong>hello@officialum1.com</strong> or use our dashboard support system.</p>0:{"buildId":"osv-C2KLdYv-LmFABT7jm","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"children":[["$","$L2",nu